      "title": "Zip tie demo",
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Try the zip tie below\nDrag the small clasp in the center to move all three wires together. Right-click the clasp and choose **Release zip tie**.\n\nTo make another tie: select two or more wires, then use the cable icon in the selection toolbar or **Zip tie selected links** in the canvas menu. No model downloads or generation needed.\n\n**Direct gesture:** hold **Cmd + Shift** on Mac or **Windows + Shift** on Windows, drag a box across two or more wires, then release the mouse to zip them. Press **Escape** to cancel."
      ]
    }
